# unknown.manifest
# A set containing records of unknown provenance. The empty license field on
# rec-2003 and the explicit UNKNOWN on rec-2005 both resolve to UNKNOWN, which
# blocks every purpose.
# Fields: record_id | spdx_id | source
rec-2001 | MIT | github.com/example/seed
rec-2002 | CC-BY-4.0 | data.example.org/set-a
rec-2003 |  | scraped.example.net/unlabelled
rec-2004 | Apache-2.0 | github.com/example/utils
rec-2005 | UNKNOWN | mirror.example.net/dump
